{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55844","headline":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 一 · 居遁","name":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夫人学道莫贪求，万事无心道合头。\n无心体得（《景德传灯录》卷二九作「始体」）无心道，体得无心道也（《景德传灯录》作「亦」）休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"居遁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55844.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55844","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}